# Regression vectors for the fixes listed in REVIEW.md.
### high-to-low-direct
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=10 escalate=0
init 0
s 0 35
s 10 35
s 20 5
s 30 5
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@10:35.000
HIGH
LOW TO_LOW@30:5.000
### deadband-boundary-symmetric
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 0 35
s 1 28
s 2 27.9
s 3 5
s 4 12
s 5 12.1
---
cfg
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@0:35.000
HIGH
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@2:27.900
LOW TO_LOW@3:5.000
LOW
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@5:12.100
### stale-tick-no-transition
