### fault-recovery-escalation-checked
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=100
init 0
s 0 35
sf 10 0
s 100 20
---
cfg
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@0:35.000
FAULT TO_FAULT@10:0.000
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@100:20.000 ESCALATE@100:20.000
### ack-does-not-ack-alarm-raised-in-same-call
